            "block_content": "22. The Union recognizes that the Employer has the duty and the right to manage the Hospital and clinics and to direct the working forces. This includes the right to hire, transfer, promote, demote, layoff, discipline and discharge employees, subject to the terms of this Agreement and the grievance procedure.",
